Copyright (c) 2026 fatal10110

This package is a command line front end: it holds no code ported from other
projects. What it reads and writes is done by the packages it depends on,
unity-asset-reader, unity-asset-reader-node, unity-asset-reader-texture,
unity-asset-reader-audio, unity-asset-reader-mesh and
unity-asset-reader-shader, which are installed beside it with their own
LICENSE and NOTICE files; see those for the projects they derive from
(AssetStudio, UnityPy and others).
